  i The main code of the loop is nested one level deeper than it needs to be, which makes it harder to follow.
  
  i Skip the iteration early with continue when the condition isn't met, then write the rest of the code after it.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Safe fix: Use an early continue instead.
  
